WEBVTT

00:09:29.923 --> 00:09:32.380
Now, you may ask:

00:09:34.341 --> 00:09:35.802
What do we do?

00:09:35.826 --> 00:09:37.428
What should our government do?

00:09:38.049 --> 00:09:41.195
Well, I'm just a mental
health professional,

00:09:41.219 --> 00:09:44.611
so all I really know is about
children's health and development.

00:09:44.635 --> 00:09:46.495
But I have some ideas.

00:09:46.519 --> 00:09:49.909
First, we need to reframe our practices.

00:09:50.748 --> 00:09:54.392
We need to replace fear and hostility

00:09:54.416 --> 00:09:56.214
with safety and compassion.

00:09:58.182 --> 00:10:00.867
We need to tear down the prison walls,